two eyes in the face of billions of voices,

263
00:29:48,294 --> 00:29:54,094
I saw the flashing lights move further in the distance,

264
00:29:55,294 --> 00:29:57,594
dream was not meant to be,

265
00:29:58,294 --> 00:30:02,094
and outside these walls that I have created,

266
